WEBVTT

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.080
(CAR HORN HONKING)

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.880
The professor knew we were coming.
教授知道我们要来的

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.360
Perhaps we've been
incorrectly labelled.
也许我们挂错标牌了

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.160
MACREADY: Come on, hup!
快点 驾

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.400
And whoa. Whoa.
吁…

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.520
-Mrs. Macready?
-I'm afraid so.
是麦瑞蒂太太吗？
恐怕我就是

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.880
Is this it, then?
Haven't you brought anything else?
就是这些吗？
你们没有带别的东西？

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.480
No, ma'am.
没有 太太

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.200
It's just us.
就我们四个

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.320
Small favours.
省了我一点麻烦

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:20.280
MACREADY: Come on. Good girl.
Come on. Come on.
快点 好马儿 快点…

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.280
Professor Kirke is not accustomed
to havin' children in this house.
寇克教授不太习惯
屋子里出现孩子

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:43.120
And, as such,
there are a few rules we need to follow.
因此 有几项规矩必须遵守

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:46.520
There will be no shoutin'. Or runnin'.
不准喊叫

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.640
No improper use of the dumbwaiter.
不准奔跑
不准乱动送货的升降机

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.760
No touchin' of the historical artefacts!
不准乱摸古董

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.640
And above all,
最重要的是

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:01.800
there shall be no disturbin'
of the professor.
不准打扰到教授

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:11.600
(GASPS)

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.400
MAN ON RADIO: German aircraft
carried out a number of attacks
德军飞机于昨晚对英国
发动了一系列空袭

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.520
on Great Britain last night.
德军飞机于昨晚对英国
发动了一系列空袭

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.040
The raids, which lasted
for several hours...
此次空袭持续了数小时之久…

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.200
(TURNS RADIO OFF)

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.640
(LUCY SNIFFLING)

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:26.640
The sheets feel scratchy.
床单好扎人

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:32.000
Wars don't last forever, Lucy.
We'll be home soon.
战争不是永远的 露西
我们很快就会回家的

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:36.200
-Yeah, if home's still there.
-Isn't it time you were in bed?
对 如果家还在的话
你是不是该睡觉了？

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:38.360
-Yes, Mum.
-Ed!
遵命 老妈
爱德!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:44.520
You saw outside. This place is huge.
你在外面也看到了
这地方很大

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.360
We can do whatever we want here.
我们想干什么都行

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.840
Tomorrow's going to be great.
明天会是美好的一天

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.160
Really.
真的

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.600
(THUNDER CLAPPING)

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.520
SUSAN: Gastrovascular.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.760
Come on, Peter. Gastrovascular.
快点 彼得 Gastrovascular

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.720
-Is it Latin?
-Yes.
这是不是拉丁语？
是的

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.960
Is it Latin for
"worst game ever invented?"
它的意思是不是
「最无聊的游戏」？

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.840
We could play hide and seek.
我们可以玩捉迷藏

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.280
But we're already having so much fun.
可我们玩的正开心呢

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.440
Come on, Peter, please.
来吧 彼得 拜托

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.840
Pretty please?
求求你啦

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.000
(WHIMPERS)
求求你啦

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:33.000
-One, two, three, four--
-What?
1 2 3 4…
什么？

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:37.200
--five, six, seven, eight,
5 6 7 8…

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:40.880
nine, ten, eleven...
9 10 11…

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:44.120
(SWING MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.240
Twenty-four, 25, 26...
…24 25 26…

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.600
I was here first!
是我先到这儿的

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:20.800
Seventy-five, 76, 77, 78, 79, 80,
…75 76 77 78 79 80…

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:25.440
81, 82, 83, 84,
…81 82 83 84…

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:30.040
85, 86, 87, 88,
…85 86 85 86 87 88…

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:34.520
89, 90, 91, 92,
89 90 91 92

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.720
93, 94, 95...
93 94 95…

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.400
(GASPS)

